From: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: netfilter: retain flow route neighbours

Keep the resolved neighbour and FIB generation with each flowtable
direction. Hardware offload drivers can then reject a stale install and
invalidate rows after neighbour or route changes instead of forwarding
indefinitely through an obsolete next hop.

Apply the same ownership and route-generation checks to nftables and the
legacy FLOWOFFLOAD target, including all allocation failure paths.

Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-5.6-sol
Signed-off-by: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
